WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:23.860
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and last night
the trailer for the new Gotham TV Show dropped

00:00:23.860 --> 00:02:03.360
so I wanted 

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:04.439
to do a breakdown.

00:02:04.439 --> 00:02:09.759
Basically as you can tell it’s like Arrow
told from Quentin’s perspective.

00:02:09.759 --> 00:02:13.810
Like a dark crime drama noir-ish cop show.

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:16.569
With superheroes floating around in the ether.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:20.280
I know a lot of you have been asking me if
I think the show is sustainable, if they can

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.280
make it for four or five seasons.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.540
So I’ll address that too.

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:26.410
If you ever read Batman Year One the comic
or saw the cartoon movie they made.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.480
Think of this like Detective Gordon Year One.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:32.319
Although technically the series picks up right
when Bruce Wayne’s parents are being killed.

00:02:32.319 --> 00:02:35.080
I would expect that to go down in the first
episode.

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:41.030
This is a Fox show, but they paid a dump truck
of money to get the rights to use all the

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:43.010
good comic book characters, except for the
Joker.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.290
No Joker.

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:48.640
Right now the roster is Ben McKenzie as Gordon,
I never watched him on Southland, but I’m

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.380
going to give him a chance.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:52.850
Jada Pinkett Smith as Fish Mooney.

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:55.450
She’s going to be a gangster, not from the
comics.

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:59.319
But in the universe the show is creating she’s
going to be the boss of the Penguin.

00:02:59.319 --> 00:03:01.790
Who’s being played by Robin Lord-Taylor.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:03.960
So this is like a very very young Oswald Cobblepot.

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:08.120
So I’m curious to see if he gets his Penguin
nickname on the show or if he’ll already

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:09.780
have it in the first episode.

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:11.209
If Arrow has been any indicator of how shows
bestow comic book identities on characters,

00:03:11.209 --> 00:03:14.220
we can bet that all the people on the show
will just start out with their regular names

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:17.050
and slowly evolve into their comic book personas
over time.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:18.629
Which I’m totally fine with.

00:03:18.629 --> 00:03:22.620
Going down the rest of the roster there’s
also the Selina Kyle Catwoman played by Camren

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:23.620
Bicondova.

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:26.040
She’s not related to Michelle Pfiefer, I
swear.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:27.640
But the resemblance is uncanny.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.900
So I’m excited to see what she what kind
of energy she channels into the character.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:33.270
Alfred Pennyworth is being played by Sean
Pertwee.

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:36.720
You might have seen him as Lestrade on Elementary.

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:41.030
He’s a lot beefier than Jeremy Irons who’s
playing Alfred in Zack Snyder’s Man of Steel

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.030
sequel.

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:45.879
I think this version of Alfred will be the
ex-british military one that the animated

00:03:45.879 --> 00:03:47.800
series explored.

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:50.800
So expect him to be a very punchy smashy version
of Alfred.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:54.080
That’s a big change from the Michael Caine
Dark Knight Alfred too, so let me know how

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:59.140
you feel about Alfred turning into a brawler
as opposed to a very polite society old world

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:01.200
person.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.200
Personally I don’t mind.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:04.069
I think it will be an interesting twist.

00:04:04.069 --> 00:04:08.700
Especially since Bruce Wayne is a little boy
on the show.

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.990
He’s being played by David Mazouz.

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:13.610
He and Selina Kyle are going to be about the
same age on the show.

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:16.459
But here’s where it gets interesting.

00:04:16.459 --> 00:04:19.959
They’ve also cast roles for Poison Ivy,
Clare Foley.

00:04:19.959 --> 00:04:22.789
She’s going to be Ivy Pepper when the show
picks up.

00:04:22.789 --> 00:04:26.069
The Riddler played by Corey Michael Smith.

00:04:26.069 --> 00:04:31.099
Also starting as Edward Nygma and the Bette
Kane Batgirl.

00:04:31.099 --> 00:04:33.289
She’s going to be played by Sara Paxton.

00:04:33.289 --> 00:04:36.919
Because she’s so much older than the rest
of the other supers I’m betting we’ll

00:04:36.919 --> 00:04:39.879
see her transformation into Bat Girl during
season 1.

00:04:39.879 --> 00:04:45.500
And she’ll fill the Batman vigilante void.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:52.550
There’s a bunch more secondary characters
like Bullock played by Donal Logue, Erin Richards

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:55.439
is playing Barbara Kean, Gordon’s wife.

00:04:55.439 --> 00:04:58.289
And Crispus Allen is being played by Andrew
Stewart Jones.

00:04:58.289 --> 00:05:02.759
That’s pretty much it for the comic book
characters, but this is only the first season.

00:05:02.759 --> 00:05:10.069
Remember how Arrow brought on Black Canary
and The Flash in Season 2.

00:05:10.069 --> 00:05:14.069
The show itself was ordered to series, which
means we’ll see Episode 1 in the fall.

00:05:14.069 --> 00:05:16.419
They’ll probably air the pilot at Comic
Con though.

00:05:16.419 --> 00:05:18.479
So if you make it you can see it early.

00:05:18.479 --> 00:05:22.969
I’m going to be doing weekly videos for
it just like Arrow and Agents of SHIELD.

00:05:22.969 --> 00:05:31.379
What I’m hoping to see is a lot of Bette
Kane Gordon scenes, Jada Pinkett Smith and

00:05:31.379 --> 00:05:35.249
Oswalt Cobblepot and Alfred Bruce scenes.

00:05:35.249 --> 00:05:38.219
But really I think what we’re all waiting
for is all the young comic book characters

00:05:38.219 --> 00:05:41.129
to interact with each other pre-persona.

00:05:41.129 --> 00:05:45.680
Like young Bruce Wayne running into Selina
Kyle and Ivy or seeing how the young villains

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:46.680
interact.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:52.740
Just like most characters I don’t think
any of them will be super evil right away.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:56.970
Usually they have to experience some major
trauma.

00:05:56.970 --> 00:06:01.719
So expect Jada Pinkett Smith to do terrible
things to Oswalt Cobblepot and I’m sure

00:06:01.719 --> 00:06:05.009
Selina Kyle is going to get terrorized.

00:06:05.009 --> 00:06:08.289
But let me know what you’re looking forward
to most?

00:06:08.289 --> 00:06:13.580
Really I am super pumped to see all the characters
meet each other before they get their masks.

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:16.099
It adds a really cool dynamic to the world
of Gotham when you know what their endgame

00:06:16.099 --> 00:06:17.099
is.

00:06:17.099 --> 00:06:18.770
As for them making it to four or five seasons.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:22.689
I think they can do it, but one of the issues
they have is having to pay Warner Brothers

00:06:22.689 --> 00:06:26.409
extra money on top of the production for all
the comic book characters.

00:06:26.409 --> 00:06:30.619
Arrow on the other hand is made by the CW,
owned by Warner Brothers, so they don’t

00:06:30.619 --> 00:06:33.580
have a lot of the added costs Gotham will
have.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:38.200
But Fox has a much larger audience than the
CW, so the idea is that they make it up on

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:40.249
all the extra advertising money they get.

00:06:40.249 --> 00:06:44.490
I think we’ll know after the first couple
of episodes whether or not season 2 will be

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:45.490
a thing.

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:46.490
I think it’s totally possible though.

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:47.490
And like I said, I’ll be doing weekly videos
for this when it starts airing, but I’ll

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:48.490
try to do more bonus videos for it as we learn
new things.

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:49.490
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:52.979
And leave me suggestions for what you want
those bonus videos to be about.

00:06:52.979 --> 00:06:55.860
Right now click here to catch up on Arrow,
there’s only two episodes left in the season

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:57.819
and it’s been really freaking good this
year.

00:06:57.819 --> 00:06:59.690
And click here to catch up on Agents of SHIELD.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:01.339
Also, only two episodes left.

00:07:01.339 --> 00:07:02.339
Hail Hydra.

00:07:02.339 --> 00:07:03.439
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:07:03.439 --> 00:07:03.569
High Fives!

